{'symbol': 'XEL', 'date': '2023-02-01 14:07:00', 'title': "XCEL ENERGY NAMED A WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANY FOR 10TH CONSECUTIVE YEAR", 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS--( BUSINESS WIRE )--FOR THE TENTH YEAR IN A ROW, XCEL ENERGY HAS BEEN HONORED AS ONE OF THE WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES BY FORTUNE MAGAZINE. THE MINNEAPOLIS-BASED UTILITY RANKED FIRST IN SOCIAL RESPONSIBILITY AND QUALITY OF MANAGEMENT, PLACING SECOND OVERALL AMONG THE MOST ADMIRED GAS AND ELECTRIC COMPANIES IN THE COUNTRY."}